<title>MAURITIUS: Three Omani drug smugglers arrested in Mauritius.</title>
<headline>Three Omani drug smugglers arrested in Mauritius.</headline>
<dateline>PORT LOUIS 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mauritius police said on Thursday they had arrested three drug smugglers with Omani passports and seized between two and three kg (4.4 to 6.6 lb) of heroin.</p>
<p>Police Commissioner Raj Dayal described it as &quot;the catch of the decade as far as the fight against drugs is concerned&quot;.</p>
<p>The three men were arrested at a hotel on Wednesday night.</p>
</text>
